            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "beejay"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We used to make similar, Watergate salad. After pudding, cool whip and marshmallows I put in whatever fruit appeals to me at the moment - usually pineapple - sometimes I add mandarin oranges, maraschino cherries, tropical fruit or mixed fruit. nuts and coconut sometimes. I'm happy with just pineapple most of the time.",
            "datePublished": "2026-02-03T02:22:37.655Z"
          },
          {
